						"text": "[color=E25A12]Alex:[/color]\n\n[color=989DB1]Are there paintings you've made in No Paint that you haven't shown anyone? How important is sharing a piece you're working on?[/color]\n\n[color=50A359]Sean:[/color]\n\n[color=989DB1]About a dozen to two dozen that are not works in progress? Most of them are from a time when I was not as confident with my No Paint abilities. Sharing/exporting paintings is very important to me because I feel good knowing that there are people who care about my work. When I don't feel good about a painting, I don't post it. Now, I just mess around the canvas to get something I like.[/color]",
